      1						.TITLE	UJLOAD
      2						.IDENT	/02.00/
      3					; CP62 ABI2 loader. RT-11 file calls + HALT vector resident calls only.
      4					; HALT helper is embedded here and copied into FRAM; no added FPGA ROM.
